s an art lovers’ paradise and has over a dozen art galleries. Provincetown has a bohemian town with art galleries lining Commercial Street. Check out the mansions of long-ago sea captains or take a stroll on the beach. In Truro, learn about and sample wines at Truro Vineyards. Wellfleet is well-known for its shellfish, including the famous \"Wellfleet oysters.\" \n\nCape Cod offers so much in a day– quaint streets, whale watching, sandy beaches, picturesque lighthouses, delicious foods, and whimsical small shops. There is something to delight all your senses.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#We look forward to you joining us! \nYour guide is Naim Benmayor and their phone number is 617-306-4877. Please reach out with any questions. Naim will be in touch soon to set up the meeting place and any custom changes to the tour.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "For all ages! • 9 Hours", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonprivateguide/items/448093/images/926375/", "pk": 926375, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/2mqtzeP4TwyzRvHxkjzF", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/2mqtzeP4TwyzRvHxkjzF", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonprivateguide/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonprivateguide/items/448093/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/2mqtzeP4TwyzRvHxkjzF", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/2mqtzeP4TwyzRvHxkjzF", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}], "created_at": "2023-03-10T16:19:19+0000", "modified_at": "2025-05-07T14:21:25+0000", "is_gratuity_enabled": false, "is_sms_reminder_enabled": false, "receipt_footer": "", "is_scanni